00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:00.140
the mobile app is a cat or not. So you can now get two sources of data. One, which

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:04.380
is the distribution of data you really care about, is data from a mobile app like

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:08.500
that on the right, which tends to be less professionally shot, less well-framed,

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:13.300
maybe even blurrier because it's shot by amateur users. The other source of

