00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:18.810
different distribution, there's a different appearance of image than the

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:24.010
one you actually want. So you don't want to use just those 10,000 images because

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:30.010
it ends up giving you a relatively small training set. And using this 200,000

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:34.730
