now your training, def, and test sets will all come from the same distribution, so

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:32.170
that makes it easier to manage. But the disadvantage, and this is a huge

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:37.930
disadvantage, is that if you look at your def set of this 2,500 examples, a

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:43.610
lot of it will come from the webpage distribution of images rather than what

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:48.570
you actually care about, which is the mobile app distribution of images. So it

