00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:06.810
is the following. The training set, let's say it's still 205,000 images, I would have

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:16.850
the training set have 200,000, all 200,000 images from the web, and then you can if

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:22.850
you want add in 5,000 images from the mobile app. And then for your dev and

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:29.450
test sets, I guess my data set size on drone to scale, your dev and test sets,

