00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:03.860
The advantage of this way of splitting up your data into train, dev and test is that

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:08.340
you're now aiming to target where you want it to be. You're telling your team,

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:13.820
